WHEN I LOOKED AT YOU IN L.A.

888
00:38:10,221 --> 00:38:13,191
IN OUR SEMI-FINALS, I WAS LIKE,

889
00:38:13,191 --> 00:38:15,426
"I DON'T EVEN THINK SHE'LL MAKE
