897
00:38:38,683 --> 00:38:41,019
YOU STOLE THAT SHOW,
THAT SHOW WAS YOURS.

898
00:38:43,388 --> 00:38:44,722
THE DECISION IS MADE.

899
00:38:50,361 --> 00:38:52,730
