906
00:39:15,119 --> 00:39:18,356
BUT I'M ALSO PLEASED BECAUSE I
MADE IT THIS FAR,

907
00:39:18,356 --> 00:39:19,991
AND A LOT OF GIRLS WOULD
DEFINITELY WANNA BE

908
00:39:19,991 --> 00:39:21,025
IN MY POSITION, AND THEY'RE NOT.

909
00:39:23,628 --> 00:39:24,729
Janice: WAY TO GO, GIRL.

910
00:39:24,729 --> 00:39:26,130
Tyra: CONGRATULATIONS.

911
00:39:26,130 --> 00:39:27,632
Adrianne: COME HERE, MISS TYRA.

912
00:39:27,632 --> 00:39:30,301
