UNDENIABLE

918
00:39:41,079 --> 00:39:43,581
AND A PERSONALITY THAT IS SO
DYNAMIC.

919
00:39:43,581 --> 00:39:47,118
ADRIANNE IS NOW,
AND ADRIANNE IS THE FUTURE.

920
00:39:47,118 --> 00:39:49,020
I DON'T KNOW WHAT TO FEEL.

921
00:39:49,020 --> 00:39:51,122
I FEEL I LOVE JANICE DICKINSON.

922
00:39:51,122 --> 00:39:52,523
WELL, I DIDN'T VOTE FOR YOU.

923
00:39:52,523 --> 00:39:53,358
Tyra: I'M PROUD OF YOU,
ADRIANNE.

924
00:39:53,358 --> 00:39:54,692
CONGRATULATIONS.

925
00:39:54,692 --> 00:39:56,527
YOU WERE THE BIGGEST
TRANSFORMATION,

926
00:39:56,527 --> 00:39:59,364
AND YOU DID IT, GIRL!

927
00:39:59,364 --> 00:40:01,666
NO MORE WAITRESSING IN JOLIET!

928
00:40:01,666 --> 00:40:04,035
Adrianne: SCREW SERVING EVER
AGAIN.

929
00:40:04,035 --> 00:40:07,272
I'M GONNA HAVE A GOOD LIFE NOW.

930
00:40:07,272 --> 00:40:09,641
MY FAMILY'S GONNA HAVE A GOOD
LIFE NOW.

931
00:40:09,641 --> 00:40:13,611
A LOT IS GOING TO CHANGE,

932
00:40:13,611 --> 00:40:15,980
